:name: MG21 generic boot harness
:description: Boots an arbitrary MG21 Zigbee application ELF on BRD4180A. Set $bin and $vtor before include, e.g. `$bin=@scripts/silabs-vuln/zb02_aqara.elf; $vtor=0x4000`.

using sysbus
emulation SetGlobalSerialExecution true
emulation CreateIEEE802_15_4Medium "wireless"

mach create "mg21"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/boards/silabs/brd4180a.repl

$vtor?=0x4000
macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu VectorTableOffset $vtor
"""
runMacro $reset

connector Connect sysbus.radio wireless
logLevel 3
